      "text": "Sure, it's Vivek Reddy and my account number is 32252095",
      "tags": [
        "identity_verification"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Thank you, Mr. Reddy. I can see you're upset about the charges, and I completely understand why that would be frustrating. Let me check the details for you.",
