      "text": "I see the charge here. It looks like a mistake on our end. I will raise a refund request for the wrong charge right now.",
      "tags": [
        "action:refund_request"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Thanks. Just to be sure, can you confirm my contact info? It's 96350 62306 and vivek.91@examplemail.com",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Yes, that is correct. Please keep in mind that the refund is subject to approval and typically takes 7-10 business days to appear in your account.",
      "tags": [
        "disclosure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Okay, that sounds fair. I appreciate you fixing this so quickly!",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "You're very welcome! Is there anything else I can assist you with today? I've submitted the request, so just keep an eye on your statement. Have a great day! 👋",
